{"title": "List of features that work in Slayer Form", "pageid": 41085, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/List_of_features_that_work_in_Slayer_Form", "categories": ["Lists"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This page is about the features that do or do not work in Slayer Form. For details on the stats and abilities of the Slayer, see <a href=\"/wiki/Slayer\" title=\"Slayer\">Slayer</a>.</div>\n<p>Most equipment, many feats, and some class passives do not work while transformed into the <a href=\"/wiki/Slayer\" title=\"Slayer\">Slayer</a>. This list clarifies what works and what does not work.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"General_Information\">General Information</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The player character can't cast spells while in Slayer Form, and can't take any action outside of those available to the Slayer. Actions will only be mentioned in this article if their effects persist after transforming.</li>\n<li>The player character's equipped items are merged into their Slayer form and most of them do not have any effect until they revert back. If any equipment is not listed here then it does not work in Slayer form.</li>\n<li>Slayer Form replaces all six of the player character's stats with those of the Slayer. This article notes any exceptions when permanent bonuses or feats actually do change those stats while in Slayer form.</li>\n<li>This list is far from complete. Any missing information can be added.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"What_works_in_Slayer_Form\">What works in Slayer Form</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Class_Features\">Class Features</span></h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Defence\" title=\"Defence\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Defence_Icon.webp/25px-Defence_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Defence_Icon.webp/38px-Defence_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Defence_Icon.webp/50px-Defence_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Defence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Defence_Icon.webp/25px-Defence_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e2/Defence_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Defence\" title=\"Defence\">Defence</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Fighting_Style\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fighting Style\">Fighting Style</a> (if you were wearing armour before transforming).</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Barbarian\" title=\"Barbarian\">Barbarians's</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rage\" title=\"Rage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Rage_Icon.webp/25px-Rage_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Rage_Icon.webp/38px-Rage_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Rage_Icon.webp/50px-Rage_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Rage_Icon.webp/25px-Rage_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Rage_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rage\" title=\"Rage\">Rage</a> (must be activated before transforming).\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Berserker\" title=\"Berserker\">Berserker's</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frenzy\" title=\"Frenzy\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Frenzy_Icon.webp/25px-Frenzy_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Frenzy_Icon.webp/38px-Frenzy_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Frenzy_Icon.webp/50px-Frenzy_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frenzy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Frenzy_Icon.webp/25px-Frenzy_