teland_Wanderer_Cold_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wasteland_Wanderer:_Cold\" title=\"Wasteland Wanderer: Cold\">Wasteland Wanderer: Cold</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wasteland_Wanderer:_Fire\" title=\"Wasteland Wanderer: Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Wasteland_Wanderer_Fire_Icon.webp/25px-Wasteland_Wanderer_Fire_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Wasteland_Wanderer_Fire_Icon.webp/38px-Wasteland_Wanderer_Fire_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Wasteland_Wanderer_Fire_Icon.webp/50px-Wasteland_Wanderer_Fire_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wasteland Wanderer: Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Wasteland_Wanderer_Fire_Icon.webp/25px-Wasteland_Wanderer_Fire_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e2/Wasteland_Wanderer_Fire_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wasteland_Wanderer:_Fire\" title=\"Wasteland Wanderer: Fire\">Wasteland Wanderer: Fire</a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wasteland_Wanderer:_Poison\" title=\"Wasteland Wanderer: Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Wasteland_Wanderer_Poison_Icon.webp/25px-Wasteland_Wanderer_Poison_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Wasteland_Wanderer_Poison_Icon.webp/38px-Wasteland_Wanderer_Poison_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Wasteland_Wanderer_Poison_Icon.webp/50px-Wasteland_Wanderer_Poison_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wasteland Wanderer: Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Wasteland_Wanderer_Poison_Icon.webp/25px-Wasteland_Wanderer_Poison_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></pi